              "width": 860,
              "content": "A warmer, softer workspace that borrows Plex's own amber: a stone-grey ground, white panels with 12 to 16 px corners, pill-shaped buttons and badges, and marigold for the main action. Headings in Bricolage Grotesque give the app a voice; everything else is Figtree with even-width figures. Fewer, larger posters; release rows stay compact at 40 px.",
