            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Q3maOR",
              "name": "Section note",
              "fill": "$mm-ink-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "Wrap any focused control: 2 px ring in mm-focus with a 2 px white gap, so it reads at 18:1 against the white gap on every fill, black, red or lime. Replace the Slot with the control instance; set cornerRadius to the control radius plus 4. On the black downloads bar or toast, set the stroke to mm-focus-on-dark and the fill to mm-bar. Rows use an inner 2 px stroke instead. Maps to Tailwind outline-2 outline-offset-2.",
