        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "F9aUl",
          "name": "Section v2/Button",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "pihB7",
              "name": "Section title",
              "fill": "$mm-ink-1",
              "content": "v2/Button",
              "fontFamily": "$mm-font-ui",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "E6N3Ya",
              "name": "Section note",
              "fill": "$mm-ink-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "One button for every action, one component. Looks via root fill and stroke: primary black (shadcn variant default), secondary white with a 3.4:1 edge (outline), ghost, destructive red, outline-destructive (custom destructive-outline), menu (outline plus Chevron, opens a DropdownMenu). Other overrides: Label, Icon (any lucide icon, or off), Kbd. Disabled uses a grey fill, never opacity. Loading swaps the icon for a spinner and keeps the width.\n\nSizes, set by overriding with the size tokens (never raw numbers): In-row: padding mm-control-px-row (10), Label mm-control-text-row (13), radius mm-control-radius-row (6), height 28, icon 14. Only inside table rows and dense lists. Default (the component as built): mm-control-px-default 16, text 14, radius 8, height 40, icon 16. Every button outside a table: page headers, panels, forms, dialogs, toolbars, settings. Large: mm-control-px-large 20, text 15, radius 10, height 48, icon 18. The one main action on a page or panel: title header actions, the grab confirmation (Replace or Second version), Settings Connect. Icon-only buttons are squares at the same three heights. Inputs, selects and segmented groups use the same tokens. The file format cannot bind height or icon size to a variable, so those are typed as the numbers in mm-control-h-* and mm-control-icon-*; change both together.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$mm-font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
