              "type": "text",
              "id": "iZR48",
              "name": "Section note",
              "fill": "$mm-ink-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "One badge, six looks, set by root fill and Label fill. Neutral (mm-surface-2, ink-2): file quality, Manual download, 2 versions. Strong (black, white): In library, stays visible on a selected row. Lime (mm-best, black text): best release and Downloading 64%, with Dot on. Risk (risk-soft, risk): Hit and run risk, Stalled, Failed. Warning (warning-soft, warning): Missing 2 episodes, Below cutoff. Outline (1 px line-strong, ink-2): Not out yet, Searching with Spinner on. Not interactive, so no hover or focus. Maps to shadcn Badge variants secondary, default, best (custom), destructive, warning (custom), outline. Icon: optional 12 px lucide icon before the label, off by default; turn it on and set its icon for states such as Not monitored (bookmark-x). Spinner stays for Searching only.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$mm-font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
