              "name": "Section note",
              "fill": "$mm-ink-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "A change the owner made that has not taken effect yet: old value, arrow, new value, on an amber tint. Shows while a monitored toggle or a setting is waiting for Sonarr or Radarr to confirm it, or while a settings edit is unsaved; it disappears once the change applies. Goes right after the value it changes: after Toggle/Bookmark on show, season and episode rows, and in place of the Note in Fact/row on settings and title headers. 20 px tall, radius 4, data font 13. In Fact/row, turn From off, since Value already shows the old value. Overrides: From, To, Arrow, Icon (clock; off when space is tight). From is ink-3, To is black, icon and arrow are mm-warning. Maps to a shadcn Badge with a custom amber variant, with an aria-label such as Monitored changing from off to on.",
