              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "The main search, modelled on Seerr and Plex web: a wide, tall field in the middle of the top bar. 48 px, radius 10, 20 px magnifier inset 16, placeholder 16 px in ink-2 (7.5:1), / key hint at right. Rest: grey mm-surface-2 fill, no edge. Hover: one step darker. Focus: white fill, 1 px line-strong edge plus the focus ring; results open below in a v2/DropdownMenu/Content with v2/Combobox item rows (library matches first, then Sonarr and Radarr). Overrides: Icon, Text (ink-2 placeholder, ink-1 typed), Clear (on when there is text), Kbd. Phone: 44 px, full width under v2/Navigation/Phone. As a plain form field (in v2/Field/labelled) it is overridden to 40 px, radius 6, white with an edge. Maps to shadcn Input opening a Command list.",
