              "content": "Label above a control, help or error below. Width follows the container. Overrides: Label, Input (a v2/Input/Search instance with Icon and Kbd off), Help, Error (on replaces Help). Saved secrets: Input Icon lock, Text dots, and a Replace ghost button in Action. Maps to shadcn Field with Label, Input and FieldDescription or FieldError. Error sizes to its text (one line) so it raises no layout warning while off; keep error messages to one short sentence.",
