              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "The add decision on a title not yet in the library (TV and movie in one). In the page flow: radius 8, 1 px line edge, padding 20, no shadow. Overrides: Heading, Monitor (v2/ToggleGroup plus More menu), Quality profile (v2/Select trigger), Minimum availability (movie only, off for TV), Search on add (v2/Option row as a checkbox), Preview, Primary, Secondary. TV mirrors Sonarr's monitor choices; movie mirrors Radarr's. Custom form from shadcn parts.",
