              "content": "One cell. Overrides: width, Value (text; replace it with a badge, mark, button or logo when needed), Sort (header cells only), root justifyContent end for numbers. Header cells use Value 11/600 capitals in ink-3. Maps to shadcn TableCell and TableHead.",
