              "id": "aGB7F",
              "name": "Section note",
              "fill": "$mm-ink-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "Release table row. Columns (fixed, same on every release table): Quality 104, Release (fill: dotted name in ink-2, group in black 700), Comparison 72 (v2/Mark/comparison, fixed next to Size so best, better, same and yours read down one line), Fit 112 (v2/Cell/profile-fit), Size 72 right, Seeders 64 right, Tracker 112 (real logo plus name), Hit and run 128 (always the rule in words, cooldown in red), Audio and HDR 140, Action 88 (Grab, sm, Kbd G). States: default, hover, pressed, focus, selected, best (best-soft tint, best mark), yours (owned file pinned under the header), rejected (dimmed, reason in Fit), cooldown, disabled grab. Maps to TanStack row in shadcn Table. Grabbed: turn Action off and Grabbed on (lime v2/Badge with Dot and the percent, same 88 px column), and turn Progress line on (v2/Progress, 3 px, black fill on a clear track along the row's bottom edge; set the Fill width to the percent of 1360). Never wrap the row or place a progress bar over it by hand.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$mm-font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
