              "fill": "$mm-ink-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "Library grid card. Poster 152 by 228 in full colour (stand-in gradients here; real art from Sonarr or Radarr as an image fill), radius 8, 1 px inner edge so light posters keep an edge. Overrides: Poster fill, Progress strip (on while downloading: 4 px lime on the poster's bottom edge, it sits on the image so lime is allowed), Hover veil, root stroke for selected, Title, Meta, Status (one v2/Badge, off when normal). States: default, hover (veil darkens the poster 8%), pressed (16%), focus (ring around the poster), selected (2 px black edge, title 700), downloading, missing, manual download, not out yet. Custom card; maps to a link with an img. Imported: Progress strip and fill on at full width (152, lime) plus Imported check on (black chip, lime check, bottom left of the poster); shows for a short while after the last file imports.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$mm-font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
